  "name": "Chicken Stock",
  "text": "Chicken Stock\n\nYield: 1.5 l\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nIngredients\n\n1 chicken (1.5 kg, blanched and refreshed),\n\n200 g carrots (cut into chunks),\n\n2 leeks (white part, cut into chunks),\n\n1 celery stalk (coarsely chopped),\n\n1 onion studded with 2 cloves,\n\n150 g button mushrooms (thinely sliced),\n\n1 bouquet garni.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put chicken in a large saucepan and cover with 2.5 l cold water.\n\n2. Bring to the boil on a high heat, then immediately lower to a simmer.\n\n3. After 5 minutes skim and add the other ingredients.\n\n4. Cook gently for 1 ½ hours without boiling, skimming when necessary.\n\n5. Strain and cool as quickly as possible.",
  "recipeYield": "1.5 l",
